<div class="banner banner-lock">The portal fee is overdue, so the monthly plan is locked. Your classes and the Join button are not affected. The plan opens again as soon as the fee is paid.</div>
<a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" asp-controller="Payments" asp-action="Index">Pay the portal fee</a>
